+$NetBSD$
+
+EmberBSD local; not submitted upstream.
+Cross builds: the raw build-host uname gate must not select Darwin
+APIs (mach_time, wide clicks, -dynamiclib) for an aarch64--netbsd target.
+Set EMBER_CROSS_TARGET_SYS to override the uname-derived system version
+for bundled package configures.
